sections.content:
In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires:
(a) "area" means the area (including all buildings, structures or other properties comprised therein) specified in the Schedule;
(b) "authorised person" means a person or body of persons or trustees of any trust authorised by the Central Government under section 7;
(c) "Claims Commissioner" means the Claims Commissioner appointed under section 8(2);
(d) "prescribed" means prescribed by rules made under this Act.
